index(domain, targets) ::= <<

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TeaQL Code Gen Server</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-main: #0f172a;
            --bg-card: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
            --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            --text-main: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --primary: #3b82f6;
            --primary-hover: #2563eb;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-main);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% -20%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0) 70%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #60a5fa, #a78bfa);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        p { color: var(--text-muted); }
        strong { color: var(--text-main); }
        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
        }

        .eyebrow {
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .hero-copy {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-size: 1.08rem;
        }
        .workflow-nav {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin: 32px 0 40px;
        }
        .workflow-nav a {
            display: block;
            padding: 14px 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.55);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 0.82rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .workflow-nav a:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .workflow-nav strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            color: #60a5fa;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
        }
        .stage {
            position: relative;
            scroll-margin-top: 24px;
        }
        .stage::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 31px;
            top: -25px;
            width: 1px;
            height: 25px;
            background: linear-gradient(var(--primary), transparent);
        }
        .stage-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }
        .stage-number {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            flex: 0 0 44px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: #dbeafe;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);
            font-weight: 700;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
        }
        .stage-title h2 {
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0 0 4px;
            border: 0;
        }
        .stage-title p {
            margin: 0;
        }
        .stage-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px;
        }
        .panel {
            padding: 18px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .panel p:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        .panel-label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #93c5fd;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        pre {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
        }
        .callout {
            margin-top: 18px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            color: #bfdbfe;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
            border-left: 3px solid #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .callout.warning {
            color: #fde68a;
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
            border-left-color: #f59e0b;
        }
        .action-row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .target-groups {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        .target-group {
            padding: 18px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .target-group h3 {
            color: #dbeafe;
        }
        .target-group ul {
            margin: 12px 0 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .target-group li {
            margin: 7px 0;
        }
        .target-group code {
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .status-levels {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 14px;
        }
        .status-level {
            padding: 12px 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.45);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.86rem;
        }
        .status-level strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            color: #dbeafe;
        }
        .feedback-loop {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 18px;
        }
        .loop-step {
            padding: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.84rem;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .loop-step strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            color: #c4b5fd;
        }
        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 2.05rem;
            }
            .workflow-nav {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .stage-grid,
            .target-groups,
            .status-levels,
            .feedback-loop {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        

        .supported-languages {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-around;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        .lang-item {
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        .lang-item:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
        }
        .lang-emoji {
            font-size: 5rem;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4));
        }
        .lang-name {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            .supported-languages {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 30px;
            }
        }
        /* Hero setup block */
        .setup-block {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .code-container {
            position: relative;
            background: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
        #endpoint-code {
            display: block;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            padding-right: 72px;
            white-space: normal;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }
        code {
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .copy-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .copy-btn:hover { background: #2563eb; }
        
        /* Two columns */
        .row {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        .col { flex: 1; min-width: 300px; }
        
        /* Preview links */
        .preview-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .link-chip {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            color: var(--text-main);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .link-chip:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        
        /* Targets list */
        .target-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        .target-tag {
            background: #1e293b;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        /* New Table and Buttons */
        .prompt-table {
            width: 100%;
            min-width: 620px;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 10px;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4);
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-style: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        .table-scroll {
            width: 100%;
            overflow-x: auto;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .prompt-table th {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.8);
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        }
        .prompt-table td {
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .prompt-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .prompt-table tr:hover td {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
        }

        .assist-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
            min-width: 80px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* Seven language columns need a compact, consistent action. Keep the
           original text in the accessibility tree and show one preview icon. */
        .prompt-table .assist-btn {
            min-width: 1.9rem;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            font-size: 0;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .prompt-table .assist-btn::before {
            content: "↗";
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .java-btn {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
            color: #fcd34d;
            border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
        }
        .java-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
            border-color: #f59e0b;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .rust-btn {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #fca5a5;
            border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
        }
        .rust-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);
            border-color: #ef4444;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .go-btn {
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
            color: #67e8f9;
            border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
        }
        .go-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);
            border-color: #06b6d4;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        
        .py-btn {
            background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.15);
            color: #fde047;
            border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
        }
        .py-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.25);
            border-color: #eab308;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .cs-btn {
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.15);
            color: #d8b4fe;
            border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
        }
        .cs-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
            border-color: #a855f7;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .ts-btn {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            color: #93c5fd;
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
        }
        .ts-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .primary-btn {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            color: #bfdbfe;
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.35);
        }
        .primary-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Modal Styles */
        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 9999;
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        .modal-overlay.active {
            opacity: 1;
            pointer-events: auto;
        }
        .modal-container {
            background: #1e293b;
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 900px;
            height: 85vh;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            transform: translateY(20px);
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }
        .modal-overlay.active .modal-container {
            transform: translateY(0);
        }
        .modal-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5);
            border-top-left-radius: 12px;
            border-top-right-radius: 12px;
        }
        .modal-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #f8fafc;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
        }
        .modal-close {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            line-height: 1;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        .modal-close:hover {
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .modal-body {
            padding: 24px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            flex: 1;
            background: #0f172a;
            border-bottom-left-radius: 12px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 12px;
        }
        .modal-body pre {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            word-break: break-word;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <span class="eyebrow">Model-driven development API</span>
            <h1>From Business Requirement to Working Software</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">TeaQL gives developers and Coding Agents one continuous, verifiable path: create a typed domain model, evaluate it, generate a domain library and application workspace, then request model-aware API help while coding.</p>
        </header>

        <div class="supported-languages">
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">☕</div>
                <div class="lang-name">Java</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">🦀</div>
                <div class="lang-name">Rust</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">🐹</div>
                <div class="lang-name">Go</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">🐍</div>
                <div class="lang-name">Python</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">🎯</div>
                <div class="lang-name">.NET</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">📘</div>
                <div class="lang-name">TypeScript</div>
            </div>
            <div class="lang-item">
                <div class="lang-emoji">🕊️</div>
                <div class="lang-name">Swift</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="language-support-notice" class="callout" role="status">
            <strong>Current verified baseline:</strong>
            Java, Rust, Go, Python, .NET, and TypeScript have each generated, compiled, and executed the Order Search core feature against real PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQLite databases.
            Java also has full-feature verification on Oracle, DB2, DM8, SAP HANA, SQL Server, and DuckDB; .NET also has full-feature verification on SQL Server.
            Swift 6 has generated and compiled domain output, a verified local SQLite runtime, and a verified TeaQL Federal Protocol client on Linux, macOS, and iOS Simulator; it participates in the same seven-language Assist matrix.
            These statements describe the dated acceptance evidence, not every version or every target exposed by this server. Review the <a href="https://teaql.io/docs/reference/runtime-database-matrix">runtime evidence matrix</a> before selecting a production combination.
            <div class="status-levels" aria-label="Verification status definitions">
                <div class="status-level"><strong>Target available</strong>The generation route and templates exist. This alone makes no build or runtime claim.</div>
                <div class="status-level"><strong>Generated &amp; compiled</strong>Generated output passed its language toolchain for the tested revision.</div>
                <div class="status-level"><strong>Runtime verified</strong>Generated code connected to the named real database and executed persistence or queries.</div>
                <div class="status-level"><strong>Full feature verified</strong>Rows, counts, aggregates, relations, saves, optimistic locking, purpose/comment, and both audit paths passed the stated scenario scope.</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <nav class="workflow-nav" aria-label="TeaQL development workflow">
            <a href="#model-source"><strong>STEP 01</strong>Requirement → Model</a>
            <a href="#model-shape"><strong>STEP 02</strong>Inspect the Model</a>
            <a href="#evaluation"><strong>STEP 03</strong>Evaluate &amp; Repair</a>
            <a href="#generation"><strong>STEP 04</strong>Generate Software</a>
            <a href="#development"><strong>STEP 05</strong>Develop with Assist</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="card setup-block">
            <h2>Connect the TeaQL Toolchain</h2>
            <p>Point <code>cargo teaql</code> or another TeaQL client at this service. Coding Agents use the client instead of calling undocumented framework APIs directly.</p>
            <div class="code-container">
                <code id="endpoint-code">export TEAQL_ENDPOINT_PREFIX=http://localhost:8080/</code>
                <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyEndpoint()">Copy</button>
            </div>
            <div class="action-row">
                <a href="services" class="assist-btn primary-btn" title="Live generation target catalog">Live Target Catalog</a>
                <a href="version" class="assist-btn primary-btn" title="Generation Service version">Server Version</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <section id="model-source" class="card stage">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">01</span>
                <div class="stage-title">
                    <h2>Where Does the Model Come From?</h2>
                    <p>A business requirement becomes a saved, reviewable KSML domain contract before application code is generated.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-grid">
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Input: business language</span>
                    <pre>Build merchant onboarding.

Each merchant belongs to a platform.
Track tax number, address, external ID,
creation time, and last update time.</pre>
                </div>
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Output: typed model artifact</span>
                    <h3>Developer or Coding Agent</h3>
                    <p>Clarifies objects, representative values, relationships, constants, ownership, and provider choice, then saves the result as XML/KSML.</p>
                    <p>The model path—not a chat transcript—is the artifact used for evaluation, review, and regeneration.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="callout">TeaQL does not treat the first AI response as truth. The model is a proposal that must pass deterministic evaluation and remain available for human review.</div>
        </section>

        <section id="model-shape" class="card stage">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">02</span>
                <div class="stage-title">
                    <h2>What Does the Generated Model Look Like?</h2>
                    <p>KSML uses concrete example values to describe fields and explicit function-like values to describe references and generated behaviors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-grid">
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Excerpt from the live demo model</span>
                    <pre>&lt;root name="crm-erp-service"
      org="doublechaintech"
      data_service="postgres"&gt;

  &lt;platform
      name="CRPERPPlatform"
      create_time="createTime()"
      last_update_time="updateTime()" /&gt;

  &lt;merchant
      name="Global Logistics Corporation"
      tax_number="91XXXXXXXXXXXXX"
      platform="platform()"
      create_time="createTime()"
      update_time="updateTime()" /&gt;

&lt;/root&gt;</pre>
                </div>
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">What the contract captures</span>
                    <h3>Types, relationships, and generation intent</h3>
                    <p>Representative values allow the evaluator and generator to infer supported field types. References such as <code>platform()</code> connect business objects. Metadata can add display names, modules, constants, identifiers, and ownership boundaries.</p>
                    <div class="preview-links">
                        <a href="model-view.html" class="link-chip">Entity Graph</a>
                        <a href="data-design-react.html" class="link-chip">Data Dictionary</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="callout warning">The snippet explains the shape; the complete model is the source of truth. Coding Agents should edit the saved model and rerun evaluation instead of patching generated entities.</div>
        </section>

        <section id="evaluation" class="card stage">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">03</span>
                <div class="stage-title">
                    <h2>What Happens After Evaluation?</h2>
                    <p>The service returns a Markdown report with Errors, Warnings, Suggestions, and confirmed solid areas.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-grid">
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Call the evaluator</span>
                    <div class="code-container">
                        <pre>cargo teaql evaluate \
  --input model/main.xml</pre>
                    </div>
                    <div class="action-row">
                        <a href="evaluate" class="assist-btn primary-btn" title="Live evaluation report for the demo model">Open Live Report</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Use structured feedback</span>
                    <pre>Evaluation Report
├── Errors       must be fixed
├── Warnings     require a decision
├── Suggestions  optional improvements
└── Solid Areas  preserve these sections</pre>
                    <p>Generation is blocked when the submitted model contains evaluation Errors. Repair the model, evaluate again, and keep the report as evidence.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feedback-loop">
                <div class="loop-step"><strong>1. Submit</strong>Saved model</div>
                <div class="loop-step"><strong>2. Read</strong>Markdown report</div>
                <div class="loop-step"><strong>3. Repair</strong>Smallest model change</div>
                <div class="loop-step"><strong>4. Repeat</strong>Until zero Errors</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="generation" class="card stage">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">04</span>
                <div class="stage-title">
                    <h2>Which Libraries and Workspaces Can TeaQL Generate?</h2>
                    <p>Generate the stable domain library separately from the editable application workspace.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="target-groups">
                <div class="target-group">
                    <h3>Domain libraries</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><code>java-lib-core</code> — Java entities, requests, expressions, metadata, and runtime registration.</li>
                        <li><code>rust-lib-core</code> — Rust entities, typed requests, expressions, behaviors, checkers, and providers.</li>
                        <li><code>golang-lib-core</code> — Go entities, typed requests, expressions, runtime helpers, and metadata.</li>
                        <li><code>python-lib-core</code> — Python entities, typed requests, runtime integration, and metadata.</li>
                        <li><code>dotnet-lib-core</code> — .NET entities, typed requests, ADO.NET integration, and metadata.</li>
                        <li><code>typescript-lib-core</code> — TypeScript entities, typed requests, and TeaQL runtime integration.</li>
                        <li><code>swift-lib-core</code> — Swift 6 entities and staged requests for local SQLite and TeaQL federation clients.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="target-group">
                    <h3>Java workspaces</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><code>java-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>java-web-spring-boot</code></li>
                        <li><code>java-web-quarkus</code></li>
                        <li><code>java-web-micronaut</code></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="target-group">
                    <h3>Polyglot workspaces</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><code>rust-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>rust-web-axum</code></li>
                        <li><code>rust-web-topcoat</code></li>
                        <li><code>golang-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>golang-web-gin</code></li>
                        <li><code>python-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>python-web-fastapi</code></li>
                        <li><code>dotnet-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>dotnet-web-aspnet</code></li>
                        <li><code>typescript-app-console</code></li>
                        <li><code>typescript-web-hono</code></li>
                        <li><code>typescript-app-expo</code> — React Native local-first application with generated Expo SQLite schema.</li>
                        <li><code>swift-app-console</code></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="target-group">
                    <h3>Design and guidance outputs</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><code>doc</code> — data-design documentation and visual previews.</li>
                        <li><code>agent</code> — generated Coding Agent instructions.</li>
                        <li><code>evaluation</code> and <code>mergemodel</code> — evaluation assets and model composition.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-grid" style="margin-top: 18px;">
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Generate a domain library</span>
                    <div class="code-container">
                        <pre>cargo teaql rust-lib-core \
  --input model/main.xml \
  --output generated/rust-lib-core</pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Generate an editable workspace</span>
                    <div class="code-container">
                        <pre>cargo teaql rust-web-topcoat \
  --input model/main.xml \
  --output generated/rust-web-topcoat</pre>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="callout">The live service catalog is authoritative for the configured endpoint. Generated workspaces reuse the matching core library; adding a web framework does not require creating another shared domain core.</div>
            <div class="action-row">
                <a href="swift-lib-core/workspace/README.md" class="assist-btn primary-btn" title="Preview the generated Swift package guide">Preview Swift Package</a>
                <a href="services" class="assist-btn primary-btn" title="Live generation target catalog">Inspect All Live Targets</a>
            </div>
            <details style="margin-top: 18px;">
                <summary style="cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-muted);">Raw target names exposed by this server</summary>
                <div class="target-list" style="margin-top: 12px;">
                    $targets:{t | <span class="target-tag">$t$</span>}$
                </div>
            </details>
        </section>

        <section id="development" class="card stage">
            <div class="stage-header">
                <span class="stage-number">05</span>
                <div class="stage-title">
                    <h2>How Does a Coding Agent Get API Help During Development?</h2>
                    <p>The Agent asks for help using the current model, language, action, and exact object name. The response is generated Markdown, not a generic ORM example.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stage-grid">
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Model-aware assist request</span>
                    <div class="code-container">
                        <pre>cargo teaql \
  --input model/main.xml \
  rust-assist-query/merchant</pre>
                    </div>
                    <p>The same pattern supports create, update, delete, expression, list-page, debug, tool API, ensure-schema, and runtime-customization guidance.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="panel">
                    <span class="panel-label">Development feedback loop</span>
                    <pre>Generated AGENTS.md
       ↓
Select language + action + object
       ↓
Call TeaQL assist API with the model
       ↓
Use exact generated methods
       ↓
Compile, test, and request more help</pre>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="callout">The complete 7 × 9 Assist matrix is rendered from the submitted model. Coding Agents must copy exact generated names (including centralized plurals), use the single runtime <code>UserContext</code> argument, enter the executable stage through <code>purpose</code>, require <code>comment</code> at execution, and attach the generated audit-reason API to every write.</div>

